<h1>About Kate</h1>
<h2>Kate Courtright has found joy in stories her entire life. A romantic at heart, she loves reading stories from a wide variety of literary genres, and most appreciates the ones that make her laugh and cry and believe in the power of love to change people’s lives.&nbsp; Kate wrote her first story, about Cinderella eating spaghetti, when she was seven years old and has been writing in one form or another ever since. She is currently writing both short and long form love stories. She lives with her family in New York City and enjoys escaping to small towns and inviting bodies of water whenever she can.</h2>
<h2>You can follow me on <a href="https://www.bookbub.com/authors/kate-courtright"><strong>Bookbub</strong></a> &amp; <a href="https://www.goodreads.com/author/show/19932939.Kate_Courtright?from_search=true&amp;from_srp=true"><strong>Goodreads</strong></a>, too!</h2>
